## 🚌 Bus Factor Analysis
Period: all history | Generated: 2026-10-24

This is a small project: 1 library file and 6 test files, all JS. The history has about 354 commits, and the per-file counts below exclude merges.

### Project-Level Bus Factor: 2

> If Troy Goode and Douglas Christopher Wilson both left, nearly all of the code would have no knowledgeable maintainer. They account for about 238 of roughly 280 attributed commits (about 85%).

**Troy Goode is the person the project depends on most.**
- He has 95 commits, the most of anyone on the files analyzed.
- He is the only top contributor who is still active. His last commit was 2026-04-10.
- Douglas Christopher Wilson has 143 commits overall, but his last one was 2021-09-07. He has been inactive for about 5 years.

### Overview

| Metric | Value |
|--------|-------|
| Source files analyzed | 7 |
| Files with exactly 1 author | 2 (29%): `test/support/env.js`, `test/vary.js` |
| Files with 2 authors | 1 (14%): `test/issue-2.js` |
| Files with 3+ authors | 4 (57%) |
| Critical single-owner files | 0 |

Authors are counted by commit name, so "Fiona Formatter" is counted as an author. Her commits are the recent style reformat. That changes the author counts for `test/error-response.js`, `test/example-app.js` and `test/test.js`.

### Critical Risk Areas

No file is both single-author and widely depended on. The single-author files are small test helpers. The real concentration is in the main file, which has many authors but one dominant one.

| File | Dominant Owner | Share | Owner Active? | Dependents | Risk |
|------|---------------|-------|---------------|------------|------|
| `lib/index.js` | Troy Goode | 29 of 62 commits (47%) | ✅ Active | 5 test files, plus the package entry point | [MEDIUM] |
| `test/example-app.js` | Troy Goode | 10 of 13 (77%) | ✅ Active | 0 | [LOW] |
| `test/issue-2.js` | Troy Goode | 10 of 12 (83%) | ✅ Active | 0 | [LOW] |
| `test/vary.js` | Troy Goode | 1 of 1 (100%) | ✅ Active | 0 | [LOW] |
| `test/support/env.js` | Douglas Christopher Wilson | 1 of 1 (100%) | ❌ Inactive (~5 years) | 0 | [LOW] |
| `test/test.js` | Douglas Christopher Wilson | 8 of 11 (73%) | ❌ Inactive (~5 years) | 0 | [MEDIUM] |

`lib/index.js` is the highest-importance file. It has 25 authors, so it is not a single-owner file. Two of the authors, Alejandro Caravaca Puchades (last commit 2015) and Simon Mansfield (last commit 2013), are long inactive.

I only counted dependents among the test files. `lib/index.js` is also the package's public entry point, so its real blast radius is every downstream user.

### Knowledge Distribution by Module

| Module | Primary Owner | Ownership % | Bus Factor |
|--------|---------------|-------------|------------|
| `lib/` | Troy Goode | 47% | 2 (Troy Goode, Douglas Christopher Wilson) |
| `test/` | Troy Goode | about 50% | 2 (Troy Goode, Douglas Christopher Wilson) |
| `.github/` (CI and config) | dependabot[bot] | mostly automated | n/a |

